WEBVTT

00:00:00.553 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.216 --> 00:00:04.270
New customers often read reviews before they choose a salon.

00:00:04.519 --> 00:00:08.295
With VaraaAi, you approve every review before it goes live,

00:00:08.245 --> 00:00:10.190
reply to customers gracefully,

00:00:10.379 --> 00:00:13.070
and invite happy customers to review you on Google too.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.671
Tap Reviews.

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:18.746
At the top are your response rate, the number of reviews awaiting approval,

00:00:18.696 --> 00:00:19.951
and your average rating.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.671
Below, filter by Awaiting, Unanswered, Published, or Hidden.

00:00:25.319 --> 00:00:28.834
A new review only appears on your salon's page after you publish it.

00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:33.634
On each review, tap Publish to make it public, or Hide if it isn't suitable.

00:00:33.971 --> 00:00:37.393
To publish all waiting four- and five-star reviews at once,

00:00:37.343 --> 00:00:38.994
tap the golden button above.

00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:41.476
To answer, tap Reply.

00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:46.588
Pick a ready-made template, such as Thank you, Appreciate it, or Apology,

00:00:46.538 --> 00:00:47.476
and adjust it.

00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:49.316
Then tap Post reply.

00:00:49.664 --> 00:00:52.196
Your reply appears right under the customer's review.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:53.792
Two more things.

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:58.383
Customers automatically get an email asking for a review after every completed booking,

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.032
so there's nothing for you to do.

00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:02.806
And if you add your Google Maps link in Settings,

00:01:02.756 --> 00:01:05.792
happy customers are invited to review you on Google as well.

00:01:05.924 --> 00:01:07.312
Now take the quiz below.
